  3 | This task quantified post-Mw 6.4 temporal evolution of seismicity and energy release in the Ridgecrest sequence, specifically to test whether the two fixed fault-oriented corridors behaved synchronously or with systematic temporal offsets before the Mw 7.1 earthquake.
